ground\">1.82%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell\">1.18<!-- -->%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground hidden md:table-cell\">Pays residents a dividend</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors bg-muted/[0.02]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Florida</span><span class=\"ml-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->FL<!-- -->)</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400\">0%</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">7.02%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell\">0.86<!-- -->%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground hidden md:table-cell\">Popular for retirees</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors \"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Nevada</span><span class=\"ml-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->NV<!-- -->)</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400\">0%</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">8.23%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell\">0.59<!-- -->%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground hidden md:table-cell\">Relies on gaming/gaming tax</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors bg-muted/[0.02]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">New Hampshire</span><span class=\"ml-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->NH<!-- -->)</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400\">0%</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">0%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell\">2.18<!-- -->%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground hidden md:table-cell\">Taxes dividends/interest only</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors \"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">South Dakota</span><span class=\"ml-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->SD<!-- -->)</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400\">0%</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">6.4%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell\">1.22<!-- -->%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground hidden md:table-cell\">Low overall tax burden</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors bg-muted/[0.02]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Tennessee</span><span class=\"ml-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->TN<!-- -->)</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400\">0%</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">9.56%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell\">0.63<!-- -->%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground hidden md:table-cell\">Hall income tax repealed 2021</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors \"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Texas</span><span class=\"ml-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->TX<!-- -->)</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400\">0%</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">8.2%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell\">1.69<!-- -->%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground hidden md:table-cell\">Higher property taxes offset</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors bg-muted/[0.02]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Washington</span><span class=\"ml-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->WA<!-- -->)</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400\">0%</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">9.41%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell\">0.92<!-- -->%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground hidden md:table-cell\">Capital gains tax since 2023</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors \"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Wyoming</span><span class=\"ml-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">(<!-- -->WY<!-- -->)</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400\">0%</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">5.36%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell\">0.61<!-- -->%</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground hidden md:table-cell\">Mineral revenue funds state</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 p-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><p>States with no income tax often compensate with higher sales or property taxes. Texas, for example, has <strong>no income tax</strong> but property taxes averaging 1.69% — among the highest in the nation. Compare total tax burden using our<!-- --> <a class=\"text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline underline-offset-2\" href=\"/compare\">state comparison tool</a>.</p></div></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><div id=\"fica-rates\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mb-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dollar-sign h-5 w-5 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\">FICA Tax<!-- --> <span class=\"gradient-text\">Rates 2026</span></h2></div><a href=\"#fica-rates\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-border/40 bg-muted/20 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg>Link here</a></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-border/20\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-500/5\">Component</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-500/5\">Rate</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-500/5 hidden sm:table-cell\">Wage Base</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-500/5 hidden md:table-cell\">Max Tax</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-500/5 hidden lg:table-cell\">Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors \"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Social Security (OASDI)</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">6.2%</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell\">$184,500</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden md:table-cell\">$11,439.00</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden lg:table-cell text-xs\">Employer matches 6.2%</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors bg-muted/[0.02]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Medicare (HI)</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">1.45%</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell\">No cap</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden md:table-cell\">No limit</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden lg:table-cell text-xs\">Employer matches 1.45%</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors \"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Additional Medicare</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">0.9%</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell\">&gt;$200,000</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden md:table-cell\">Varies</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden lg:table-cell text-xs\">Employee only; no employer match</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors bg-muted/[0.02]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Self-Employment Tax</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">15.3%</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell\">92.35% of net SE income</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden md:table-cell\">$22,878.00 (SS portion)</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden lg:table-cell text-xs\">Social Security portion capped at $184,500</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-4\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">Combined Employee FICA</p><p class=\"text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400\">7.65%</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">6.2% SS + 1.45% Medicare</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-4\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">Self-Employment Tax</p><p class=\"text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400\">15.3%</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">On 92.35% of net SE income</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-4\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-foreground mb-1\">Max SS Tax (Employee)</p><p class=\"text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400\">$11,439</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">6.2% × $184,500</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><div id=\"standard-deductions\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mb-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-5 w-5 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\">Standard<!-- --> <span class=\"gradient-text\">Deductions 2026</span></h2></div><a href=\"#standard-deductions\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-border/40 bg-muted/20 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg>Link here</a></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-border/20\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-500/5\">Filing Status</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-500/5\">Deduction Amount</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors \"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Single</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$16,100</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors bg-muted/[0.02]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Married Filing Jointly</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$32,200</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors \"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Head of Household</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$24,150</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors bg-muted/[0.02]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Married Filing Separately</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$16,100</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors \"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Additional (Age 65+ or Blind)</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$2,000 (S/MFS/HOH) / $1,600 (MFJ/QW)</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><div id=\"retirement-limits\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mb-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-piggy-bank h-5 w-5 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 17h3v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3a3.16 3.16 0 0 0 2-2h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-1a5 5 0 0 0-2-4V3a4 4 0 0 0-3.2 1.6l-.3.4H11a6 6 0 0 0-6 6v1a5 5 0 0 0 2 4v3a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1z\"></path><path d=\"M16 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M2 8v1a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h1\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\">401(k) &amp; Retirement<!-- --> <span class=\"gradient-text\">Limits 2026</span></h2></div><a href=\"#retirement-limits\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-border/40 bg-muted/20 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg>Link here</a></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-border/20\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-500/5\">Plan</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-500/5\">Limit</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-500/5 hidden sm:table-cell\">Catch-Up (50+)</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-500/5 hidden md:table-cell\">Total (50+)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors \"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">401(k) / 403(b) / 457</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$24,500</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell text-xs\">$8,000 (age 50+)</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm hidden md:table-cell\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$32,500</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors bg-muted/[0.02]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Enhanced Catch-up (60–63)</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$24,500</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell text-xs\">$11,250 (age 60–63)</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm hidden md:table-cell\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$35,750</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors \"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Traditional &amp; Roth IRA</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$7,000</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell text-xs\">$1,000 (age 50+)</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm hidden md:table-cell\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$8,000</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors bg-muted/[0.02]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">HSA — Individual</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$4,300</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell text-xs\">$1,000 (age 55+)</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm hidden md:table-cell\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$5,300</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors \"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">HSA — Family</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$8,550</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell text-xs\">$1,000 (age 55+)</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm hidden md:table-cell\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$9,550</span></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors bg-muted/[0.02]\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Simple IRA</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$16,500</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground hidden sm:table-cell text-xs\">$3,500 (age 50+)</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm hidden md:table-cell\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-400\">$20,000</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Use our<!-- --> <a class=\"text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 underline underline-offset-2\" href=\"/401k-retirement-calculator\">401(k) calculator</a> <!-- -->to project your retirement savings with these limits.</p></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><div id=\"tax-deadlines\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 mb-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-landmark h-5 w-5 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 18v-7\"></path><path d=\"M11.12 2.198a2 2 0 0 1 1.76.006l7.866 3.847c.476.233.31.949-.22.949H3.474c-.53 0-.695-.716-.22-.949z\"></path><path d=\"M14 18v-7\"></path><path d=\"M18 18v-7\"></path><path d=\"M3 22h18\"></path><path d=\"M6 18v-7\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\">Key Tax<!-- --> <span class=\"gradient-text\">Deadlines 2026</span></h2></div><a href=\"#tax-deadlines\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-border/40 bg-muted/20 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg>Link here</a></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-border/20\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-500/5\">Date</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-emerald-500/5\">Event</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm whitespace-nowrap\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-foreground\">Jan 15, 2026</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Q4 2025 estimated tax payment due</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm whitespace-nowrap\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-foreground\">Jan 31, 2026</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">W-2 and 1099 forms due to recipients</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm whitespace-nowrap\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-foreground\">Mar 16, 2026</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">S-Corp and Partnership tax returns due</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm whitespace-nowrap\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-foreground\">Apr 15, 2026</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Individual tax return (Form 1040) due — or file extension</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm whitespace-nowrap\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-foreground\">Apr 15, 2026</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Q1 2026 estimated tax payment due</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm whitespace-nowrap\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-foreground\">Jun 15, 2026</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Q2 2026 estimated tax payment due</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm whitespace-nowrap\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-foreground\">Sep 15, 2026</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Q3 2026 estimated tax payment due</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-border/10 last:border-0 hover:bg-muted/5 transition-colors\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm whitespace-nowrap\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-foreground\">Oct 15, 2026</span></td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Extended individual tax returns due</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column h-5 w-5 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-foreground\">Embed This <span class=\"gradient-text\">Data</span></h3><p class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Copy the iframe code to embed any data section on your website. Free with attribution.</p></div></div><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg>Show Embed Codes</button><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"></path></svg><p>You can also download the raw data as CSV using the button in the sales tax table above. All data is free to use with attribution:<!-- --> <code class=\"bg-muted/30 px-1 rounded text-[10px]\">TheTaxCalc. (2026). [Section Title]. https://thetaxcalc.com/tax-data</code></p></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 p-6 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-5 w-5 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\">Source &amp; <span class=\"gradient-text\">Methodology</span></h2></div><div class=\"space-y-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\"><p>All data on this page comes directly from official government sources. We do not estimate, round, or derive figures from secondary sources.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 ml-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/60 shrink-0 mt-2\"></span><span><strong class=\"text-foreground\">Federal tax brackets</strong> — IRS Revenue Procedure for annual inflation adjustments</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/60 shrink-0 mt-2\"></span><span><strong class=\"text-foreground\">State sales tax rates</strong> — Each state&#x27;s Department of Revenue + Tax Foundation</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/60 shrink-0 mt-2\"></span><span><strong class=\"text-foreground\">FICA rates &amp; wage base</strong> — Social Security Administration and CMS</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/60 shrink-0 mt-2\"></span><span><strong class=\"text-foreground\">Retirement limits</strong> — IRS cost-of-living adjustments + SECURE 2.0</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/60 shrink-0 mt-2\"></span><span><strong class=\"text-foreground\">Property tax rates</strong> — Tax Foundation and state assessor data</span></li></ul><p>We update this page within <strong class=\"text-foreground\">48 hours</strong> of official government publication. If you spot an error, please contact us.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-6\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-5 w-5 text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground\">Tax Data <span class=\"gradient-text\">FAQ</span></h2></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><details class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/10 transition-colors\"><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base\">Can I use this data in my article, report, or website?</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Yes — that is the purpose of this page. All data is free to cite, link to, and embed. Click the &quot;Cite&quot; button on any section for an APA-formatted citation, or use the &quot;Embed&quot; button to get iframe code for your website. Attribution with a link to thetaxcalc.com is appreciated.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/10 transition-colors\"><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base\">Where does this data come from?</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Federal tax data comes from IRS Revenue Procedures and SSA publications. State sales tax data is sourced from each state&#x27;s Department of Revenue and the Tax Foundation. FICA rates are set by the Social Security Administration. We update within 48 hours of official government publications.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/10 transition-colors\"><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base\">How often is the data updated?</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">We update this page within 48 hours of any official government publication. Federal brackets are typically updated in October/November of each year. State rates may change throughout the year as legislatures pass new tax laws.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/10 transition-colors\"><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base\">Can I download the data as CSV or spreadsheet?</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Yes. Use the &quot;CSV&quot; button in the sales tax table to download all 50 states&#x27; rates as a CSV file. This can be opened in Excel, Google Sheets, or any spreadsheet application.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/10 transition-colors\"><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base\">Which states have no sales tax?</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Five states have no state or local sales tax: Delaware, Montana, New Hampshire, and Oregon. Alaska has no state sales tax but allows local taxes (avg 1.82%). These states are highlighted in the sales tax table above.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/10 transition-colors\"><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base\">Which states have no income tax?</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Nine states have no state income tax on wages: Alaska, Florida, Nevada, New Hampshire, South Dakota, Tennessee, Texas, Washington, and Wyoming. New Hampshire taxes dividends and interest but not wages. See the detailed comparison table above.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/10 transition-colors\"><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base\">What is the Social Security wage base for 2026?</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">The 2026 Social Security (OASDI) wage base is $184,500. The 6.2% Social Security tax applies only to the first $184,500 of earned income, for a maximum employee contribution of $11,439.00.</div></details><details class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 overflow-hidden\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/10 transition-colors\"><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base\">How much can I contribute to my 401(k) in 2026?</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">The 2026 401(k) contribution limit is $24,500. If you are 50+, you can add $8,000 in catch-up contributions ($32,500 total). Under SECURE 2.0, workers aged 60–63 have an enhanced catch-up of $11,250 ($35,750 total).</div></details></div></section><section class=\"border-t border-border/20 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-6\">Related Resources</h2><div class=\"grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground mb-3\">Embed Widgets</h3><div class=\"space-y-2\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/widgets\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"></span>Free Calculator Widgets</a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/widgets#link-to-us\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"></span>Link to Us</a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/widgets#widgets\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"></span>Browse All 20 Widgets</a></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground mb-3\">Calculators</h3><div class=\"space-y-2\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/paycheck-calculator\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"></span>Paycheck Calculator</a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/sales-tax-calculator\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"></span>Sales Tax Calculator</a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/mortgage-calculator\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"></span>Mortgage Calculator</a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/capital-gains-calculator\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"></span>Capital Gains Calculator</a></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground mb-3\">State Data</h3><div class=\"space-y-2\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/compare\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"></span>Compare State Taxes</a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/salary\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"></span>Salary After Tax</a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/federal-tax-brackets\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"></span>2026 Tax Brackets</a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/methodology\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"></span>Methodology &amp; Data Sources</a></div></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/30 bg-card/50 p-5\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground mb-3\">More</h3><div class=\"space-y-2\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/glossary\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"></span>Tax Glossary</a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/blog\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"></span>Blog &amp; Guides</a><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\" href=\"/about\"><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/40 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors\"></span>About TheTaxCalc</a></div></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-auto border-t border-border/30 glass-strong\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500/5 via-emerald-500/10 to-emerald-500/5 border-b border-border/20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between\"><div class=\"text-center sm:text-left\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-foreground\">Stay Updated on <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">Tax Changes</span></h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Get the latest tax tips, calculator updates, and financial insights delivered to your inbox.</p></div><div class=\"flex w-full max-w-sm gap-2\"><input type=\"email\" data-slot=\"input\" class=\"file:text-foreground selection:bg-primary selection:text-primary-foreground dark:bg-input/30 flex h-9 w-full min-w-0 rounded-md border px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive bg-background/50 border-border/30 placeholder:text-muted-foreground\" aria-label=\"Email address for newsletter\" placeholder=\"Enter your email\" value=\"\"/><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive shadow-xs hover:bg-primary/90 h-9 px-4 py-2 has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-emerald-500 text-white hover:from-emerald-500 hover:to-emerald-400 shrink-0\">Subscribe</button></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 transition-opacity hover:opacity-90\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-emerald-600 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dollar-sign h-4 w-4 text-white\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground\">TheTaxCalc<span class=\"gradient-text\">.com</span></span></a><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Precision tax calculators for 2026. Compute your take-home pay, plan your mortgage, and compare state taxes — all free, all accurate.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-emerald-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg>2026 Tax Data</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-muted/30 px-2.5 py-1\">Secure &amp; Private</span></div></div><div><h3 class=\"mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-foreground\">Calculators</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground underline underline-offset-2 decoration-border/50 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-400 hover:decoration-emerald-400\" href=\"/paycheck-calculator\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dollar-sign h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><path d=\"M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg>Paycheck Calculator</a></li><li><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground underline underline-offset-2 decoration-border/50 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-400 hover:decoration-emerald-400\" href=\"/illinois-tax-calculator\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4